    <system:String x:Key="StartInstall">開始安裝</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="ConnectPhoneTitle">請連接 iPhone</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="ConnectPhoneBody">Apple USB 支援已準備就緒。請連接並解鎖 iPhone；手機出現提示時按一下「信任這部電腦」。偵測到裝置後會自動繼續。</system:String>
